    {
      "id": 45,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Availability (1h rolling) \u2014 dashed: SLO 99.5% \u00b7 SLA 99% (illustrative)",
      "description": "The same SLI over a rolling hour, to show when budget was spent. The SLA line is illustrative: this app has no customer contract, but an SLA is always set looser than the SLO so a problem is caught internally before a contract is breached.",
